    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65261" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαυρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαυρόω</span>
			, <i>darken, blind</i>: hence, <i>make powerless</i>, dub.
			in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				358
			</span></i> (lyr.), cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>make dim</i> or <i>obscure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεῖα δέ μιν μαυροῦσι θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					325
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become dim</i> or <i>obscure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				192
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				296
			</span></i>.</div>
